device/google/sabrina16/proprietary/*
!device/google/sabrina16/proprietary/README.md

# Images and archives
*.img
*.zip
*.apk
*.apex
*.capex

# Keys and certificates
*.pem
*.pk8
*.key
*.p12
*.jks
*.keystore
*.avbpubkey
avb_pkmd.bin

# Device data
*.bugreport
bugreport-*
last-kmsg*
env*.img
